bservation post where you have a Spy; the Spy stays there. Infiltrate recalls your Spy from a connected post to bypass another player's Agent at that destination, but not your own Agent. Gather Intelligence recalls a connected Spy after placing your Agent and before receiving space or card effects to draw a card. The same Spy cannot pay for both, though two different Spies can be used for the two effects. A Spy cannot be recalled for both effects on the same placement.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Spies & observation posts: Spy Agent icon does not recall; Infiltrate and Gather Intelligence recall connected Spies; Gather is chosen just after placement before effects."}}
