{"Q": {"id": "Q08", "question": "If you pass Combat Intrigue and an opponent then plays one, may you act again? When does the window close, and where do troops and sandworms go after rewards?"}, "K": {"id": "Q08", "expected_answer": "May act again after earlier pass; closes only when all involved players pass consecutively. Adjust strength for effects. After all rewards troops return to supply not garrison, sandworms to bank, Combat markers reset zero.", "source_references": "Main p14 / extraction 744–750,767–769", "novelty": "Combat priority and cleanup"}, "R": {"id": "Q08", "corrected_authoritative_source_references": [{"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [817, 822], "pdf_pages": [14], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}, {"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [842, 843], "pdf_pages": [14], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}]}, "A": {"id": "Q08", "answer": "Yes. Passing does not prevent you acting again if an opponent plays; the Combat Intrigue window closes after all players involved in Combat pass consecutively. After rewards, troops return to each player’s supply, Combat markers reset to 0, and sandworms return to the bank.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Combat: players may play or pass; not required to pass after earlier pass; consecutive passes close. Cleanup returns troops, resets markers, returns worms."}, "B": {"id": "Q08", "answer": "Yes. Passing earlier does not bar you from playing later; the window closes after all players involved pass consecutively. After rewards, troops return to their supply (not garrison), sandworms return to the bank, and 