{"Q": {"id": "Q09", "question": "Compare two players tied for first in a four-player Conflict with the same tie in a three-player Conflict. Who takes the Conflict card, and can a zero-strength player get a reward?"}, "K": {"id": "Q09", "expected_answer": "Each tied first gets second reward and nobody wins or takes card. In four-player game remaining players compete for third; in three-player game no further rewards. Zero strength never rewarded.", "source_references": "Main p14 / extraction 765,792–808", "novelty": "Tie for first outcome branches"}, "R": {"id": "Q09", "corrected_authoritative_source_references": [{"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [839, 839], "pdf_pages": [14], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}, {"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [868, 883], "pdf_pages": [14], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}]}, "A": {"id": "Q09", "answer": "With exactly two tied for first in a four-player Conflict, each tied player gets the second reward; the other two compete for the third reward. No one wins the Conflict and nobody takes its card. In a three-player Conflict, the two tied first each get second reward, no other reward is given, and nobody takes the card. A zero-strength player receives no reward.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Combat ties: exactly two tied first with 4 players leaves others competing for third; 3 or fewer give no other rewards. Strength/rewards: zero strength no reward."}, "B": {"id": "Q09", "answer": "With exactly two tied for first in four-player play, each tied player gets the second reward; the remaining players compete for the third reward. Nobody wins the Conflict or takes its card. With two tied for first in a three-player game, each gets the second reward and there are no other rewards; nobody takes the card. A player with 0 strength receives no reward.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Combat ties: first-place tie gives second reward; in four players exactly two tied first leave other players competing for third; no tied-first winner/card. Zero strength gets no reward."}}
{"Q": {"id": "Q10", "question": "What does a sandworm do to rewards: do two sandworms quadruple them, can control or battle icons double, and how is a reward offering 3 spice for 1 VP handled?"}, "K": {"id": "Q10", "expected_answer": "One or more sandworms doubles, never quadruples. Control and battle icons do not double. Optional reward cost may be paid second time: 3 spice for 1 VP or 6 for 2, not free second VP.", "source_references": "Main p14 / extraction 778–791", "novelty": "Doubling scope and cost exception"}, "R": {"id": "Q10", "corrected_authoritative_source_references": [{"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [854, 862], "pdf_pages": [14], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}]}, "A": {"id": "Q10", "answer": "Having one or more sandworms doubles your rewards once; multiple worms do not multiply it again. Control of a location and battle icons on won Conflict cards cannot be doubled. For a reward offering 3 spice to gain 1 VP, you may pay 3 spice once for 1 VP, or pay 6 spice to take it twice for 2 VP.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Sandworm Reward Doubling: one or more worms double; control and battle icons cannot; optional cost may be paid again (3 spice example)."}, "B": {"id": "Q10", "answer": "Having one or more sandworms doubles the rewards once; additional worms do not multiply it further. Control of a location and battle icons on a won Conflict card cannot be doubled. For a reward offering 1 VP for 3 spice, you may pay 3 spice a second time to take that reward again, for 2 VP total at 6 spice; paying only once yields one instance.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Sandworm Reward Doubling: one or more worms double rewards; control and battle icons excluded; optional reward costs may be paid a second time."}}
