{"Q": {"id": "Q20", "question": "A Rival reveals an occupied board space, then a Place Spy card. How does it proceed, which space costs and effects apply, and what happens when House Hagal is empty or Reshuffle is drawn?"}, "K": {"id": "Q20", "expected_answer": "Occupied: ignore and reveal again. Place Spy tries empty designated post, ignore placement if none, then reveal another card regardless because no Agent sent. Ignore normal space costs/effects; use Hagal effects only. Empty deck or Reshuffle: immediately reshuffle Hagal and continue.", "source_references": "Supplements PDF p4", "novelty": "Rival card resolution"}, "R": {"id": "Q20", "corrected_authoritative_source_references": [{"source": "S", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-supplements.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [233, 238], "pdf_pages": [4], "sha256": "ce8e2d26252d71fb45e531b07160b494059c13ebb37f0668b9cd86a4c5854315"}, {"source": "S", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-supplements.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [254, 264], "pdf_pages": [4], "sha256": "ce8e2d26252d71fb45e531b07160b494059c13ebb37f0668b9cd86a4c5854315"}]}, "A": {"id": "Q20", "answer": "For an occupied indicated destination, ignore it and reveal another Hagal card. A Place Spy card does not place an Agent: try an empty post of the specified type, ignore placement if none exists, and immediately reveal another card either way. Ignore ordinary space costs and effects; apply only Hagal effects. If Hagal empties or Reshuffle appears, immediately reshuffle and continue.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Rival Agent turns: skip occupied destinations; Place Spy handling; ignore normal costs/effects; reshuffle."}, "B": {"id": "Q20", "answer": "For an occupied destination, ignore it and reveal another House Hagal card. A Place Spy card does not place an Agent: try an empty post of the specified type; if none exists, ignore placement, then immediately reveal another card. Ignore normal space costs and effects, applying only Hagal effects. If Hagal empties or Reshuffle appears, immediately reshuffle and continue.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Rival Agent turns; Place Spy cards; ignore normal space costs/effects; reshuffle rule."}}
