ruitment rule."}, "B": {"id": "Q22", "answer": "The bank resources and sandworms are not limited; make convenient substitutions if they run out. By contrast, you cannot recruit more troops if your personal supply is empty until troops return there. Resource gains come from the bank and payments are returned to it; the summary does not say to take resources from another player's supply.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Setup: resources and sandworms are not meant to be limited; gains from bank and payments return to bank. Recruiting: empty troop supply prevents recruiting."}}
