{"Q": {"id": "Q80", "question": "At Round Start, where is the newly revealed Conflict placed, what happens to any unclaimed Conflict card left from earlier rounds, and does each player draw the round’s five cards before or after revealing the Conflict?"}, "K": {"id": "Q80", "expected_answer": "Reveal top Conflict face up in space next to deck, on top of any Conflict cards still there from earlier rounds. Then each player draws five; card not won in previous round is not taken into a player supply by this placement.", "source_references": "Main PDF p8 / extraction 355–360", "novelty": "Current/unclaimed Conflict card destination and replacement order, previously only key background in Q23"}, "R": {"id": "Q80", "corrected_authoritative_source_references": [{"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [399, 402], "pdf_pages": [8], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}]}, "A": {"id": "Q80", "answer": "Reveal the new Conflict and place it face up next to the deck on top of any cards left from earlier rounds. Those unclaimed cards remain there underneath. Players draw five cards after the Conflict reveal.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Phase 1: Round Start."}, "B": {"id": "Q80", "answer": "At Round Start, reveal the top Conflict card and place it face up next to the deck, on top of any Conflict cards left from earlier rounds; those unclaimed cards remain there. Resolve the defensive bonus, then each player draws five cards, so the Conflict is revealed before the hand draw.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Round Start: reveal Conflict on top of remaining cards, then draw five."}}
