he Shield Wall token is initially on its marked area below Spice Refinery.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Setup steps 1 and 6; Maker Hooks/Wall setup context."}, "B": {"id": "Q81", "answer": "Each human puts one cube on the bottom space of each of the four Faction Influence tracks. Alliance tokens begin on the marked areas of those tracks; no human starts holding one. The Shield Wall token is placed on the board below Spice Refinery during setup.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Setup steps 1 and 6; normal setup assigns no Maker Hooks, but Alliance tokens are on track spaces."}}
