{"chunk_id":"e5e222","wall_time_seconds":0.593978281,"exit_code":0,"original_token_count":3675,"output":"{"Q": {"id": "Q82", "question": "In a normal three- or four-player round, who takes the first Player Turn, how does turn order proceed after someone Reveals, and exactly when does Player Turns end? During Combat Intrigue, who has first priority, in which direction does priority proceed, and how many Combat Intrigues may an eligible player play before yielding?"}, "K": {"id": "Q82", "expected_answer": "Player Turns starts with the First Player marker and proceeds clockwise one turn at a time. Skip anyone who has already Revealed; the phase ends when all players have Revealed. Combat Intrigue likewise begins with First Player and proceeds clockwise among players with at least one unit in the Conflict; each may play any number or pass.", "source_references": "Main PDF pp8,14; run extraction lines397–459,813–826", "novelty": "Turn priority, skipped players and phase termination are not requested by Q03/Q08/Q23; Q19 only asks the two-player Rival order. Any-number Combat permission is also unasked."}, "R": {"id": "Q82", "corrected_authoritative_source_references": [{"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [404, 420], "pdf_pages": [8], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}, {"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [817, 820], "pdf_pages": [14], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}]}, "A": {"id": "Q82", "answer": "The First Player takes the first turn and play proceeds clockwise, one turn at a time. Revealed players are skipped for the rest of Player Turns; in standard 3–4 player 