{"Q": {"id": "Q88", "question": "You lack the resource for a destination’s entry cost. May you first play and resolve a Plot Intrigue during that Agent turn to obtain it, then pay entry and send the Agent? Contrast trying to use resources from the card played to send that Agent, or from the destination itself, to pay that same entry cost."}, "K": {"id": "Q88", "expected_answer": "Yes, if the Plot Intrigue is legally playable and provides the needed resource before placement/payment: Plot Intrigues may be played at any point during one of the player’s Agent turns. Pay the destination cost before resolving the destination or played Agent-card effects, so those later gains cannot fund their own entry.", "source_references": "Main PDF pp7–9; run extraction lines390–394,418–430,504–519", "novelty": "Consequential pre-entry Plot timing is not tested by Q04’s Agent-card/space prohibition or Q31’s broad card-type windows. It is not permission to pay a cost retroactively; the Plot actually resolves before entry."}, "R": {"id": "Q88", "corrected_authoritative_source_references": [{"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [390, 390], "pdf_pages": [7], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}, {"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [418, 420], "pdf_pages": [8], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}, {"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [482, 506], "pdf_pages": [9], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f1